<title>AUSTRALIA: National Foods relocates milk management.</title>
<headline>National Foods relocates milk management.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food group National Foods Ltd said on Thursday it will relocate management of its milk and international divisions to Melbourne.</p>
<p>The move follows the transfer of the dairy food division to Melbourne and last year's decision to build a A$57 million greefields dairy foods plant at Morwell in Victoria.</p>
<p>National Foods said it would also relocate its small corporate head office to Melbourne in early 1998, but juice division management would remain at Smithfield in Sydney.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
